msgstr "pridruženje"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:32
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"One of the most convenient aspects of &kde;, is its ability to automatically "
"match a data file with its application. As an example, when you click on "
"your favorite &calligrawords; document in the filemanager, &kde; "
"automatically starts &calligrawords;, and automatically loads that file into "
"&calligrawords; so you can begin working on it."
msgstr ""
"Jedan od najugodnijih aspekata &kde;, je mogućnost automatskog prepoznavanja "
"aplikacije koja odgovara datoteci. Na primjer, kada kliknete na Vaš omiljeni "
"&calligrawords; dokument u upravljaču datoteka, &kde; automatski pokreće "
"&calligrawords;, i automatski učitava dokument u &calligrawords; da možete "
"početi rad na njemu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the example above, the &calligrawords; Data file is <emphasis>associated</"
"emphasis> with &calligrawords; (the application). These file associations "
"are crucial to the functioning of &kde;."
msgstr ""
"U primjeru iznad, &calligrawords; dokument je <emphasis>povezan</emphasis> "
"sa &calligrawords; (aplikacijom). Ovo povezivanje datoteka je od ključne "
"važnosti za funkcioniranje &kde;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When &kde; is installed, it automatically creates hundreds of file "
"associations to many of the most common data types. These initial "
"associations are based on the most commonly included software, and the most "
"common user preferences."
msgstr ""
"Kada je &kde; instaliran, on automatski kreira stotine datoteka povezanih sa "
"mnogim od najpoznatijih tipova datoteka. Ova inicijalna povezivanja su "
"baziraa na najčešće uključenom softveru, i najčešćim korisničkim postavkama."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid "Unfortunately, &kde; can not:"
msgstr "Nažalost, &kde; ne može:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid "predict every possible combination of software and data files"
msgstr "predvidjeti svaku moguću kombinaciju softvera i datoteke"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid "prepare for file formats not yet invented"
msgstr "biti spremam na formate datoteka koje još nisu izumljene"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid "or predict everyone's favorite application for certain file formats"
msgstr ""
"ili predvidjeti bilo čiju najdražu aplikaciju za određeni tip dokumenta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can change your current file associations or add new file associations "
"using this module."
msgstr ""
"Možete promijeniti trenutno povezivanje datoteka ili dodati novo povezivanje "
"koristeći ovaj modul."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each file association is recorded as a mime type. &MIME; stands for "
"<quote>Multipurpose Internet Mail Extensions</quote>. It allows a computer "
"to determine the type of file, without opening and analyzing the format of "
"each and every file."
msgstr ""
"Svako povezivanje datoteka je snimljeno kao mime tip. &MIME; je kraćenica za "
"<quote>Multipurpose Internet Mail Extensions</quote>. Ono omogućava "
"kompjuteru da odredi koji je vrste datoteka, bez otvaranja i analiziranja "
"formata svakog od datoteka."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to use this module"
msgstr "Kako koristiti ovaj modul"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can start this module by opening &systemsettings; and selecting "
"<guilabel>File Associations</guilabel> in the <guilabel>Common Appearance "
"and Behavior</guilabel> category. Alternatively, you can start it by typing "
"<command>kcmshell4 filetypes</command> from the terminal or &krunner;."
msgstr ""
"Možete pokrenuti ovaj modul otvarajući &systemsettings; i birajući "
"<guilabel>Povezivanja datoteka</guilabel> u kategoriji <guilabel>Čest izgled "
"i ponašanje</guilabel>Alternativno, možete početi kucati <command>kcmshell4 "
"filetypes</command> iz terminala &krunner;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The file associations are organized into several categories, and at a "
"minimum you will have:"
msgstr ""
"Povezivanja datoteka su organizovana u nekoliko kategorija, i minimalno ćete "
"imati:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "Application"
msgstr "Program"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid "Audio"
msgstr "Zvukovi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "Image"
msgstr "Slika"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid "Inode"
msgstr "Inode"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid "Message"
msgstr "Poruka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:84
#, no-c-format
msgid "Multipart"
msgstr "Višedjelna"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid "Text"
msgstr "Tekst"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid "Video"
msgstr "Video"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "All of the file associations are sorted into one of these categories."
msgstr "Sva povezivanja datoteka su podijeljena u jednu od ovih kategorija."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There is no functional difference between any of the categories. These "
"categories are designed to help organize your file associations, but they do "
"not alter the associations in any way."
msgstr ""
"Ne postoji funkcionalna razlika izmađu kategorija. Ove kategorije su "
"dizajnirane da Vam pomognu organizirati povezivanja datoteka, ali one ne "
"mijenjaju povezivanja ni na koji način."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The categories are listed in the box labeled <guilabel>Known Types</"
"guilabel>."
msgstr "Ove kategorije su izlistane pod <guilabel>Poznati tipovi</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can explore each of these categories, and see the file associations "
"contained within each one, by simply double-clicking on the category name. "
"You will be presented with a list of the associated mime-types under that "
"category."
msgstr ""
"Možete pretraživati svaku od ovih kategorija, i vidjeti povezivanja datoteka "
"sadržana u svakom, duplim klikom na ime kategorije. Bit će prikazana lista "
"povezanih mime-tipova po kategorijama."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also search for a particular &MIME; type by using the search box. "
"The search box is labeled <guilabel>Find file type or filename pattern</"
"guilabel> and is located above the category list."
msgstr ""
"Možete također tražiti određeni &MIME; tip koristeći kvadratić za pretragu. "
"On se zove <guilabel>Nađi tip datoteka ili uzorak imena</guilabel> i lociran "
"je iznad liste kategorija."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Simply type the first letter of the &MIME; type you are interested in. The "
"categories are automatically expanded, and only the mime-types that include "
"that letter are displayed."
msgstr ""
"Jednostavno ukucajte prvo slovo &MIME; tipa koji Vas zanima. Kategorije se "
"automatski proširuju, i samo mime-tipovi koji imaju to slovo u imenu će biti "
"prikazani."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can then enter a second character and the mime-types will be further "
"limited to mime types containing those two characters."
msgstr ""
"Onda možete ukucati drugi karakter i mime-tipovi će biti dalje filtrirani na "
"mime tipove koji sadrže ta dva karaktera."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding a new mime type"
msgstr "Dodavanje novog mime tipa"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to add a new &MIME; type to your file associations, you can "
"click on the <guibutton>Add...</guibutton> button. A small dialog box will "
"appear. You select the category from the drop down box labeled "
"<guilabel>Group</guilabel>, and type the &MIME; name in the blank labeled "
"<guilabel>Type name</guilabel>. Click <guibutton>OK</guibutton> to add the "
"new mime type, or click <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> to not add any new "
"mime-types."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite da dodatne novi &MIME; tip u vaša povezivanja datoteka, možete "
"kliknuti na dugme <guibutton>Dodaj...</guibutton>. Mali okvir će se "
"pojaviti. Odaberite kategoriju iz opadajuće liste pod naslovom  "
"<guilabel>Grupa</guilabel>, i ukucajte ime &MIME; tipa u prazan prostor "
"označen sa <guilabel>Ukucajte ime</guilabel>. Kliknite na <guibutton>OK</"
"guibutton> da dodate novi mime-tip, ili na <guibutton>Odustani</guibutton> "
"da ne dodate novi mime-tip."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid "Removing a mime type"
msgstr "Uklanjanje mime tipa"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to remove a &MIME; type, simply select the &MIME; type you want "
"to delete by clicking once with the mouse on the &MIME; type name. Then "
"click the button labeled <guibutton>Remove</guibutton>. The &MIME; type will "
"be deleted immediately."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite ukloniti &MIME; tip, jednostavno odaberite &MIME; tip koji želite "
"obrisati jednim klikom miša na ime &MIME; tipa. Onda kliknite na dugme "
"<guibutton>Ukloni</guibutton>. &MIME; tip će biti odmah izbrisan."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:142
#, no-c-format
msgid "Editing a mime types properties"
msgstr "Uređivanje osobina mime tipova"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:144
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Before you can edit a &MIME; types property, you must first specify which "
"&MIME; type. Simply browse through the categories until you find the &MIME; "
"type you want to edit, then click once on it with the mouse."
msgstr ""
"Da biste mogli promijeniti osobine &MIME; tipa, morate prvo odabrati koji "
"&MIME; tip želite promijeniti. Jednostavno pronađite u kategorijama &MIME; "
"tip koji želite mijenjati, i onda kliknite mišem na njega."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As soon as you have selected the &MIME; type, the current values of the "
"&MIME; type will appear in the module window."
msgstr ""
"Čim ste odabrali &MIME; tip, trenutne vrijednosti &MIME; tipa će se pojaviti "
"u prozoru modula."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:152
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You will notice the current values are split into two tabs: "
"<guilabel>General</guilabel> and <guilabel>Embedding</guilabel>"
msgstr ""
"Primijetit ćete da su trenutne vrijednosti podijeljene u dva taba: "
"<guilabel>Općenito</guilabel> i <guilabel>Nadogradnja</guilabel>"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:157
#, no-c-format
msgid "General"
msgstr "Općenito"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:159
#, no-c-format
msgid "There are 4 properties for each &MIME; type in this tab:"
msgstr "Postoje 4 osobine za svaki &MIME; tip u ovom tabu:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Mime Type Icon</guilabel> is the icon that will be visible when "
"using &dolphin; or &konqueror; as a file manager."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Ikona mime tipa</guilabel> je ikona koje će biti vidjljiva "
"prilikom korištenja &dolphin; ili &konqueror; kao upravitelja datotekama."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:165
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Filename Patterns</guilabel> is a search pattern which &kde; will "
"use to determine the &MIME; type."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Obrasci imena datoteka</guilabel> je obrazac za pretragu koji će "
"&kde; koristiti da prepozna &MIME; tip."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Description</guilabel> is a short description of the file type. "
"This is for your benefit only."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Opis</guilabel> je kratak opis tipa datoteke. Ovo služi samo radi "
"vašeg uvida."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Application Preference Order</guilabel> determines which "
"applications will be associated with the specified &MIME; type."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Red prioriteta aplikacija</guilabel> određuje koje aplikacije će "
"biti povezane sa kojim &MIME; tipom."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:177
#, no-c-format
msgid "Embedding Tab"
msgstr "Tab za ugradnju"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Embedding tab allows you to determine if a file will be viewed within a "
"filemanager window, or by starting the application."
msgstr ""
"Tab za ugradnju Vam omogućava da odlučite da li će datoteka biti prikazana u "
"prozoru upravitelja datotekama, ili pokretanjem aplikacije."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:189
#, no-c-format
msgid "Changing the Icon"
msgstr "Mijenjanje ikone"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To change the icon, simply click on the Icon button. A dialog box will "
"appear, which will show you all available icons. Simply click once with the "
"mouse on the icon of your choice, and click <guibutton>OK</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"Da promijenite ikonu, jednostavno kliknite dugme Ikona. Pojavit će se okvir "
"koji Vam pokazuje dostupne ikone. Jednotavno kliknite jednom mišem na ikonu "
"po vašem izboru, i kliknite <guibutton>OK</guibutton>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:199
#, no-c-format
msgid "Editing the mime-type patterns"
msgstr "Dodavanje uzorka mime-tipa"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The box labeled <guilabel>Filename Patterns</guilabel>, determines what "
"files will be included within this mime-type."
msgstr ""
"Prostor pod nazivom <guilabel>Uzorci imena datoteka</guilabel>, određuju "
"kakve datoteke će biti uključene u ovaj mime-tip."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:204
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Usually, files are selected based on their suffix. (Examples: Files that end "
"with <literal role=\"extension\">.wav</literal> are sound files, using the "
"WAV format and files that end in <literal role=\"extension\">.c</literal> "
"are program files written in C)."
msgstr ""
"Obično, datoteke su odabrane na osnovu njihovog sufiksa. (Na primjer: "
"Datoteke koje završavaju na <literal role=\"extension\">.wav</literal> su "
"glasovni tipovi, koriste WAV format, a datoteke koje završavaju na <literal "
"role=\"extension\">.c</literal> su programi napisani u C-u)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:209
#, no-c-format
msgid "You should enter your filename mask in this combo box."
msgstr "Trebate unijeti Vašu masku za ime datoteke u kombo kvadratić."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:211
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The asterisk (<literal>*</literal>) is a wildcard character that will be "
"used with nearly every mime type mask. A complete discussion of wildcards is "
"beyond the scope of this manual, but it is important to understand that the "
"asterisk (in this context), <quote>matches</quote> any number of characters. "
"As an example: <userinput>*.pdf</userinput> will match <filename>Datafile."
"pdf</filename>, <filename>Graphics.pdf</filename> and <filename>User.pdf</"
"filename>, but not <filename>PDF</filename>, <filename>Datafile.PDF</"
"filename>, or <filename>.pdf</filename>."
msgstr ""
"Zvjezdica  (<literal>*</literal>) je zamjenski znak koji će koristiti gotovo "
"svaka maska mime tipa. Kompletna diskusija vezano za zamjenske znakove "
"izlazi iz okvira ovog priručnika, ali je bitno da razumijete da zvjezdica (u "
"ovom kontekstu), <quote>mijenja</quote> bilo koji znak ili broj. Na "
"primjer:  <userinput>*.pdf</userinput> se poklapa sa <filename>ImeDatoteke."
"pdf</filename>, <filename>Grafikes.pdf</filename> i <filename>Korisnik.pdf</"
"filename>, ali ne i sa <filename>PDF</filename>, <filename>ImeDatoteke.PDF</"
"filename>, ili <filename>.pdf</filename>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:222
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is very beneficial to have multiple masks. One for lower case, one for "
"upper case, &etc; This will help ensure that &kde; can determine the file "
"type more accurately."
msgstr ""
"Veoma je korisno imati duple makse. Jedna za mala slova, jedna za velika, "
"&etc; Ovo će pomoći da se osigura da će &kde; prepoznati o kojem se tipu "
"radi sa većom preciznošću."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:229
#, no-c-format
msgid "Editing a mime types description."
msgstr "Podešavanje opisa mime tipa."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:231
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can type a short description of the &MIME; type in the text box labeled "
"<guilabel>Description</guilabel>. This label is to help you, it does not "
"affect the function of the &MIME; type."
msgstr ""
"Možete dodati kratak opis &MIME; tipa u kvadratić za tekst pod nazivom "
"<guilabel>Opis</guilabel>. Ovaj opis je tu da Vam pomogne, i ne mijenja "
"funkcionalnosti &MIME; tipa."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid "Editing the application associations"
msgstr "Podešavanje povezivanja aplikacija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are five buttons (<guibutton>Move Up</guibutton>, <guibutton>Move "
"Down</guibutton>, <guibutton>Add</guibutton>, <guibutton>Edit</guibutton> "
"and <guibutton>Remove</guibutton>) and a list box (which lists the "
"applications) which are used to configure the applications."
msgstr ""
"Postoji pet dugmadi (<guibutton>Pomjeri gore</guibutton>, <guibutton>Pomjeri "
"dole</guibutton>, <guibutton>Dodaj</guibutton>, <guibutton>Uredi</guibutton> "
"i <guibutton>Ukloni</guibutton>) i lista (koja izlistava aplikacije) koji su "
"korišteni za podešavanje aplikacija."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:245
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The list box lists all of the applications associated with a specific &MIME; "
"type. The list is in a specific order. The top application is the first "
"application tried. The next application down the list is the second, &etc;"
msgstr ""
"Lista prikazuje sve aplikacije povezane sa određenim &MIME; tipom. Ova lista "
"je poredana u specijalnom poretku. Gornja aplikacija se prva pokušavaja "
"pokrenuti. Sljedeća ispod je je druga, &etc;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:250
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"What do you mean there is more than one application per &MIME; type? Why is "
"this necessary?"
msgstr ""
"Kako mislite da postoji više aplikacije za jedan &MIME; tip? Je li to "
"neophodno?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:253
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"We started out by saying that &kde; comes preconfigured with hundreds of "
"file associations. The reality is, each system that &kde; is installed on "
"has a different selection of applications. By allowing multiple associations "
"per &MIME; type, &kde; can continue to operate when a certain application is "
"not installed on the system."
msgstr ""
"Na početku je spomenuto da &kde; dolazi sa stotinama prekonfigurisanih "
"povezivanja aplikacija. Ustvari, svaki sistem na kom se instalira &kde; im "
"drugačiji skup aplikacija. Dozvoljavajući višestrukost povezivanja za jedan "
"&MIME; tip, &kde; može da nastavi izvršavanje i ako neka aplikacija nije "
"instalirana na sistem."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:260
#, no-c-format
msgid "As an example:"
msgstr "Na primjer:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:261
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For the &MIME; type <literal>pdf</literal>, there are two applications "
"associated with this file type. The first program is called &okular;. If "
"your system does not have &okular; installed, then &kde; automatically "
"starts the second application &krita;. As you can see, this will help keep "
"&kde; running strong as you add and subtract applications."
msgstr ""
"Za &MIME; tip <literal>pdf</literal>, postoje dvije aplikacije povezane sa "
"ovim tipom datoteke. Prvi program se zove &okular;. Ako vaš sistem nema "
"&okular; instaliran, onda će &kde; automatski pokrenuti drugu aplikaciju "
"&krita;. Kao što možete vidjeti, ovo pomaže da &kde; radi stabilno kada "
"dodajete i uklanjate aplikacije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:269
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"We have established that the order is important. You can change the order of "
"the applications by clicking once with the mouse on the application you want "
"to move, and then clicking either <guibutton>Move Up</guibutton> or "
"<guibutton>Move Down</guibutton>. This will shift the currently selected "
"application up or down the list of applications."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:276
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can add new applications to the list by clicking the button labeled "
"<guibutton>Add</guibutton>. A dialog box will appear. Using the dialog box, "
"you can select the application you want to use for this mime type. Click "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton> when you are done, and the application will be "
"added to the current list."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:282
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To change the options of an application for a particular &MIME; type select "
"it in the list and then press the <guibutton>Edit...</guibutton> button. "
"This opens a new dialog with <guilabel>General</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Permissions</guilabel>, <guilabel>Applications</guilabel> and "
"<guilabel>Preview</guilabel> tabs. On the <guilabel>Applications</guilabel> "
"tab you can edit <guilabel>Name</guilabel>, <guilabel>Description</guilabel> "
"and <guilabel>Comment</guilabel>. In the <guilabel>Command</guilabel> field "
"you can have several place holders following the command, which will be "
"replaced with the actual values when the actual program is run:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:293
#, no-c-format
msgid "%f - a single file name"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:294
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"%F - a list of files; use for applications that can open several local files "
"at once"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:296
#, no-c-format
msgid "%u - a single URL"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:297
#, no-c-format
msgid "%U - a list of URLs"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:298
#, no-c-format
msgid "%d - the folder of the file to open"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:299
#, no-c-format
msgid "%D - a list of folders"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:300
#, no-c-format
msgid "%i - the icon"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:301
#, no-c-format
msgid "%m - the mini-icon"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:302
#, no-c-format
msgid "%c - the caption"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:305
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can remove an application (thereby ensuring that the application will "
"never run with this &MIME; type by clicking once on the name of the "
"application, and clicking the <guibutton>Remove</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:310
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is a good idea to use the <guibutton>Move Up</guibutton> and "
"<guibutton>Move Down</guibutton> buttons to adjust the unwanted application "
"to a lower position in the list, rather than deleting the application from "
"the list entirely. Once you have deleted an application, if your preferred "
"application should become compromised, there will not be an application to "
"view the data document."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:320
#, no-c-format
msgid "Embedding"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:321
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These settings are valid only for &konqueror; used as file manager, "
"&dolphin; is not able to use embedded views and opens a file always in the "
"associated application."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:323
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By clicking on the <guilabel>Embedding</guilabel> tab, you are presented "
"with four radio buttons in the <guilabel>Left click action</guilabel> group. "
"These determine how the filemanager views the selected &MIME; type:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:329
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show file in embedded viewer"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:330
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this is selected, the file will be shown <emphasis>within</emphasis> the "
"filemanager window."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:331
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show file in separate viewer"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:332
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This will cause a separate window to be created when showing this mime-type."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:333
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use settings for 'application' group"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:334
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This will cause the mime-type to use the settings for the mime-type group. "
"(if you are editing an audio mime type, then the settings for the audio "
"group are used)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:336
#, no-c-format
msgid "Ask whether to save to disk instead"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:337
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This setting applies only to &konqueror; in browser mode and determines if "
"the file is shown in an embedded viewer or if you are asked to save the file "
"to disk instead."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:341
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Below this is a listbox labeled <guilabel>Services Preference Order</"
"guilabel>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:344
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you use a filemanager like &dolphin; or &konqueror;, you can "
"<mousebutton>right</mousebutton> mouse click, and a menu will with an entry "
"labeled <guimenu>Open with...</guimenu> will appear. This box lists the "
"applications that will appear, in the order they will appear, under this "
"menu."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:350
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can use the <guibutton>Move Up</guibutton> and <guibutton>Move Down</"
"guibutton> buttons to change the order."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:356
#, no-c-format
msgid "Making changes permanent"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:358
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you are done making any changes to mime types, you can click "
"<guibutton>Apply</guibutton> to make your changes permanent, but keep you in "
"this module."
msgstr ""
